Rashmi H, a Ph.D. scholar under the supervision of Prof. Ashvini Chaturvedi from the Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, NITK has received the
Best Paper Award
for the paper titled “Performance Analysis of MISO Multiple Non-Cooperative STAR-RIS Assisted Distributed Wireless Systems” at the 12th IEEE International Conference on Electronics, Computing and Communication Technologies (
IEEE CONECCT 2026
), Bangalore, held from July 2–5, 2026

Vedant Sabnis (B. Tech. 6th Sem, Mech. Engg.), Dr. Ranjith M (Associate Professor, Mech. Engg.),
received BEST PAPER AWARD in 6th International Conference on Advances in Mechanical Engineering (ICAME-2026
) held SRM Institute of Science and Technology, Tamil Nadu, India in association with the University of Split, Croatia, during 18-20 March 2026.
